sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant rwsdk as RWSDK Starter Kit
    participant pds as Local PDS
    participant plc as Local PLC

    User->>rwsdk: Submit Handle
    rwsdk->>pds: Resolve Handle
    pds->>rwsdk: Return DID
    rwsdk->>plc: Resolve DID
    plc->>rwsdk: Return PDS service endpoint
    rwsdk->>pds: Initialize OAuth PAR
    rwsdk->>User: Redirect to Login / Approval
    User->>pds: Auth request processed
    pds-->>User: Redirect to callback URL
    User->>rwsdk: Callback with auth code
    rwsdk->>pds: Exchange auth code for session token
    rwsdk->>User: Redirects user to post-login homepage